    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報343期封面作品-枋山泊地"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEglqaF2-hZgedsauXlCmZG2BOq2-fBowDEDF216MXuGqow8xVkiqWMAIGqyufbzWUQQcbKQ2igbvATFTOBB4GAWAJsi0dRSBfvFVaasJhn3NiUS0PCnRtIBTNQPKdcd1Y30JjkI9c7FLPQn_CxfBV0gArkIX9eMAHJ-FMLTioP1MA30I4VpKP9MB1aw7Q/s4788/2019%E5%B1%8F%E6%9D%B1%E6%9E%8B%E5%B1%B1%E6%B3%8A%E5%9C%B0(60.5cm%20x%2080cm)%E6%B2%B9%E5%BD%A9%E7%95%AB%E5%B8%83.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3493\" data-original-width=\"4788\" height=\"466\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEglqaF2-hZgedsauXlCmZG2BOq2-fBowDEDF216MXuGqow8xVkiqWMAIGqyufbzWUQQcbKQ2igbvATFTOBB4GAWAJsi0dRSBfvFVaasJhn3NiUS0PCnRtIBTNQPKdcd1Y30JjkI9c7FLPQn_CxfBV0gArkIX9eMAHJ-FMLTioP1MA30I4VpKP9MB1aw7Q/w640-h466/2019%E5%B1%8F%E6%9D%B1%E6%9E%8B%E5%B1%B1%E6%B3%8A%E5%9C%B0(60.5cm%20x%2080cm)%E6%B2%B9%E5%BD%A9%E7%95%AB%E5%B8%83.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">枋山泊地——屏東縣枋山鄉</span></td></tr></tbody></table><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/s1424/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/w450-h640/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品名稱</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">枋山泊地</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作品說明：</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：陳玉珠</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">材料：油畫</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">尺寸：60.5cmX80cm</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">年代：2019</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">枋山ê地形長長瘦瘦ná魚niā，tī恆春半島屏鵝公路占一段長長ê海岸線，m̄-koh漁業署ê漁港名單內面，枋山無漁港。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ē專工駛車去枋山，是因為hia有一間枋山國小，tī半世紀前，學生時代ê屏東少年tshuā領三个同學騎跤踏車去遊墾丁，第一日騎到枋山天beh暗--ah，in就tī tsit个國小借所在過暝，值班老師開一間教室hōo in歇跤。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">四个少年仔kā學生桌仔鬥鬥--leh做眠床。半暝雄雄落大雨，兩个海巡人員看教室有燈光，入來巡邏，kā in tshuā tńg去辦公室詢問，看學生證了後，就放in走--ah。無張持hông驚--著，koh規身tâm-lok-lok，留落少年時代難忘ê記憶。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit回是武鎮beh tshuā我去「舊地重遊」，liū往事--lah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">車駛到接近枋山ê時，suah影著海岸有幾隻塑膠棑仔。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">既然有棑仔，án-ne，kám是有漁港？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">原本就beh tī正手爿路仔uat--入-去，因為枋山國小tī路ê另外一爿。一下uat--入-去，隨看著一棟掛「 枋山安檢所」牌仔ê建築物，啊，有安檢所，就是有漁港，為啥mi̍h漁業署ē kā伊làu-kau--去--neh？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">停車場就tī安檢所邊--a ê樹跤，車停好，阮就tuì邊--a ê路仔ǹg海邊行，一塊仔崎崎ê石頭仔路，suà--落-去就看著海--ah，五六隻棑仔恬恬排tī石頭仔頂，四箍圍仔siòng-siòng--leh——無！無港，無碼頭、無整網場……海景清靜，一phiàn曠闊，原來，有船無港，tse只是泊地。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無港有船，海巡mā ài設立安檢所。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">翻頭行倚安檢所，門窗關ân-ân，無聽著啥mih聲，阮想講，是m̄是以前有海巡人員，tsit-má已經撤銷--ah？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雄雄，「inn-uainn！」中ng ê兩扇門拍開--lah！出現兩位穿柑仔色海巡制服ê女士，面模仔五官tsiok明，目睭大大蕊，皮膚烏金烏金，一看就是Paiwan（『排灣』）族原住民。Sio借問，了解枋山泊地ê情形，原來in ê責任m̄-nā是hit幾隻棑仔ê出入，重點是巡防海岸線，顧lán國土ê海岸安全。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">枋山m̄是漁港，入畫mā無礙--著。Tī沙埔ê棑仔後壁，透過棑仔頂簡單交叉ê竹篙，看ǹg大海，án-ne ê構圖，有一種天kuân海闊ê感覺，設備兩光ê棑仔輕koh巧，有飄撇ê美感--neh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> 343期，2022年10月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
  },
